--- Per-Page, Per-Viewport Verification ---

1. Product Listing Page (ShopPage)
   Desktop 1920x1080:  PASS — Grid layout with product cards, images load, price displays correct
   Desktop 1440x900:   PASS — Grid scales, no overflow, filter sidebar visible
   Tablet 768x1024:    PASS — Grid collapses to 2 columns, filter sidebar collapses to hamburger/accordion
   Mobile 375x812:     PASS — Single-column layout, stacked product cards, filters accessible via toggle
   Mobile 360x640:     PASS — Same as 375x812, no horizontal scroll
   Console errors:     None

2. Product Detail Page (ProductDetailPage)
   Desktop 1920x1080:  PASS — Product image gallery renders, add-on selectors (fall/in-skirt) visible,
                               price updates dynamically when add-ons selected
   Desktop 1440x900:   PASS — Same layout, responsive image scaling
   Tablet 768x1024:    PASS — Image and details stack vertically, add-on selectors usable
   Mobile 375x812:     PASS — Full-width image, add-on dropdown selectors are touch-friendly,
                               no clipping or overflow on selector elements
   Mobile 360x640:     PASS — Same as 375x812, all interactive elements accessible
   Console errors:     None

3. Blouse Enquiry / Add-On Flow (within ProductDetailPage)
   Desktop 1920x1080:  PASS — Fall and in-skirt add-on selectors render below product info,
                               selecting an add-on updates the line item price in real time,
                               "Add to Cart" button includes selected add-ons
   Desktop 1440x900:   PASS — Same behavior, no layout issues
   Tablet 768x1024:    PASS — Add-on selectors stack below product image, dropdowns functional
   Mobile 375x812:     PASS — Dropdown selectors open correctly (no clipping by viewport edge),
                               touch targets meet minimum 44px size
   Mobile 360x640:     PASS — Same as 375x812
